{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38301","headline":"倒押前韵 · 韩偓","name":"倒押前韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"白下同归路，乌衣枉作邻。\n佩声犹隔箔，香气已迎人。\n酒劝杯须满，书羞字不匀。\n歌怜黄竹怨，味实碧桃珍。\n翦烛非良策，当关是要津。\n东阿初度洛，杨恽旧家秦。\n粉化横波溢，衫轻晓雾春。\n鵶黄双凤翅，麝月半鱼鳞。\n别袂飜如浪，回肠转似轮。\n後期才注脚，前事又含颦。\n纵有才难咏，宁无画逼真。\n天香闻更有，琼树见长新。\n鬬草常更仆，迷阄误达晨。\n齅花判不得，檀注惹风尘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩偓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38301.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38301","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}